WEBVTT

00:06:58.452 --> 00:07:03.233
a silver ox,

00:07:03.233 --> 00:07:06.675
yes, okay, a red donkey,

00:07:06.675 --> 00:07:10.050
and what was the emerald color? A rooster.

00:07:10.050 --> 00:07:14.120
An emerald rooster. Okay.

00:07:14.120 --> 00:07:16.286
Now for the moment of truth, Gwen,

00:07:16.286 --> 00:07:17.971
we're going to take a look in that envelope.

00:07:17.971 --> 00:07:19.886
Why don't you open it up and remove

00:07:19.886 --> 00:07:21.178
the one piece of paper from inside

00:07:21.178 --> 00:07:22.207
and hand it to me,

00:07:22.207 --> 00:07:26.910
and we will see if it matches your choices.

00:07:26.910 --> 00:07:28.345
Yes, I think it does.

00:07:28.345 --> 00:07:29.909
We have a cobalt horse, we have a red donkey,

00:07:29.909 --> 00:07:32.206
we have an amber owl, we have
an emerald rooster, a silver ox,